\f2\fs32 \cf0 Valeria Vegas
\f0\b0  has a degree in Audiovisual Communication. Since 2015 she is a columnist and writes in several Spanish media such as 
\f2\b Vanity Fair, Shangay, Candy, Lecturas
\f0\b0 \'85.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Co-writer together with Los Javis of the series \'94Veneno\'94, she is the author of four books \'94Grandes Actrices del Cine Espa\'f1ol\'94, \'94Ni puta ni santa. Las memorias de La Veneno\'94, \'94Vestidas de azul. Social and cinematographic analysis of the transsexual woman in the years of the Spanish Transition\'94, and her book, \'94Lib\'e9rate\'94, collects the history of LGBTQ culture that paved the way in Spain. In 2023 she published her first fiction novel \'94Actriz de Reparto\'94
\f3\fs24 \

\f2\b\fs32 \'a0
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She has directed the documentary \'94Manolita, La Chen de Arcos\'94, awarded as best Spanish documentary at LesGaiCineMad 2016, which collects the testimony and experiences of the first transsexual mother who managed to adopt in Spain. His directing projects also include \'91El enigma Nadiuska\'92, for 
\f2\b Atresmedia
\f0\b0 . He has been part of the 
\f2\b Canal Sur
\f0\b0  program, \'94El Legado\'94, aimed at remembering artists of yesteryear; as well as in the inclusive spot of Tinder on the occasion of World Pride. She has also been a talk show host in different colloquiums such as \'94El Congreso del Bienestar\'94, from 
\f2\b Cadena SER
\f0\b0 ; the exhibition \'94Cultura Basura\'94 from 
\f2\b La T\'e9rmica
\f0\b0  in M\'e1laga, the 
\f2\b Rizoma Festival
\f0\b0  in Madrid, \'91Periodismo, divas y cultura popular\'92, for 
\f2\b Imagincaf\'e9 Barcelo
\f0\b0 na (La Caixa); or the round table \'91Memoria colectiva, cultura popular y estrellas, organized by the 
\f2\b Universidad Carlos III.
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f2\b\fs32 \'a0
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Co-writer of the series \'93Veneno, Atresplayer, and its continuation, \'93Vestidas de azul\'94, adaptations of her books, produced by Suma Content. In television she has collaborated in the morning magazine \'93La hora de la 1\'94 in TVE and \'93Ya son las 8\'94 in Telecinco. She is currently a weekly contributor to the program \'93Y ahora Sonsoles\'94. She has directed the documentary series \'93Nadiuska\'94 for Atresplayer. She is also an ambassador for The Body Shop.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She is one of the ambassadors of
\f2\b  The Body Shop 
\f0\b0 for its campaign \'93Self Love Uprising\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She has collaborated with brands such as Lecturas, Mastercard \'85. as well as acting as master of ceremonies for Forbes Power Summit Women or Corufest.
\f3\fs24 \
