\f2\fs32 \cf0 Andrea Tivadar
\f0\b0  is a British actress of Romanian origin who currently divides her time between London and Barcelona. She decided to change career by graduating from the 
\f2\b University \'91QMUL\'92- School of Materials Science and Engineering
\f0\b0 . After finishing her training in 2012, she debuted in the role of Pam, in the Spanish film \'94The Adventures of Jesus Maria Cristobal Peque\'f1o\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She started singing at the age of 6 and in March 2015 she was invited to sing with Poncho, an Argentinian band, in their concert in Barcelona. That same year, Andrea appeared in the music video \'94Elle m\'92a aim\'e9\'94 by Kendji Girac which was received with more than 80 million views on YouTube. 2016 was marked by her promotional tour for 
\f2\b Kingsglaive
\f0\b0 : Final Fantasy XV for which she did panels at the ComiCon San Diego International 
\f2\b Film Festival, Los Angeles and Sitges.
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Andrea plays the lead role in the Spanish production \'93Blood Metal Revenge\'94 which was in the official competition at the Sitges Film Festival 2019. In addition, she appeared in 2 episodes of 
\f2\b HBO 
\f0\b0 hit TV series \'93Killing Eve\'94 (season 2). Last but not least, Andrea is the main character in the movie \'93Safe Inside\'94, released in 2020 for which she was nominated for 2 \'93Best Actress\'94 awards at US festivals, and stars in the movie \'93Lumina\'94, directed by
\f2\b  Gino McKoy, playing Dellah.
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 For the second time, she is the international image of the watch brand 
\f2\b Festina 
\f0\b0 alongside Gerard Butler. In addition, in 2019 she starred in an editorial in 
\f2\b Vogue 
\f0\b0 Spain during the Pride celebration.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Andrea speaks English, Spanish, Romanian and French.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Her last two projects have been \'94Mat\'e9 a un Tipo\'94, a play at 
\f2\b Espacio R (Barcelona)
\f0\b0 , and \'94Mi cuerpo mi casa\'94, a But\'f3 dance piece together with Aymara Padr\'f3n, directed by Natalia L\'f3pez Santa Cruz.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Andrea has been chosen as ambassador of the Italian firm of ceremony,
\f2\b  Antonio Riva
\f0\b0 , during the Bridal Week 2021 in Barcelona, closing her parade with the designer.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She is the worldwide image of 
\f2\b Lindt 
\f0\b0 and worked as a model for brands such as 
\f2\b Seat.
\f3\b0\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She has recently worked on two major projects for the streaming platform 
\f2\b Netflix
\f0\b0 , \'93Si Lo Hubiera Sabido\'94 (Netlifx Spain) and season 2 of \'93Warrior Nun\'94 (Netflix USA).
\f3\fs24 \
