\f2\fs32 \cf0 David Castillo
\f0\b0  began to speak almost between cameras, because when he was only 7 years old, his parents introduced him to the world of advertising after he saw an ad for breakfast, where they took children in a kind of spaceship. That\'92s when he decided that he also wanted to dedicate himself to that. After that initial career as an advertising image, he took part in several television series such as \'94Hospital Central\'94, \'94Ana y los 7\'94 and \'94Manolito Gafotas\'94, based on the homonymous character of Elvira Lindo, giving life to Jihad during thirteen chapters. The leap to cinema took place in 2004, with a minor role in \'94El s\'e9ptimo d\'eda\'94 by Carlos Saura and another of greater importance in \'94Cachorro\'94 where he played Bernardo, a nine year old boy who, due to circumstances, has to live with his homosexual uncle.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 In 2005, he joined the cast of \'94Aida\'94 with which he achieved great popularity throughout its almost ten years of broadcasting, playing Jonathan Garcia, the youngest of the children of Aida Garcia.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 From 2011, he began to act in plays, such as \'94M\'fcnchhausen\'94, \'94Naturaleza muerta en una cuneta\'94 (2012-2013) or \'94Emilia\'94 (2014).
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 In 2015 he was selected to be part of the 
\f2\b Joven Compa\'f1\'eda Nacional de Teatro Cl\'e1sico
\f0\b0 . One of his latest theatrical participations has been the play \'94Lulu\'94, with which he has toured several cities in our country.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 David is a music lover, a passion that has led him to play in private parties, clubs and festivals around the country. His followers are very loyal and follow them both in these sessions and in their social networks, so there are many brands that have been interested in collaborating with him.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 He has participated in the filming of \'93Los Nuestros Dos\'94, the second season of the 
\f2\b Telecinco 
\f0\b0 miniseries and in the 
\f2\b Antena 3 
\f0\b0 series \'93Amar es para Siempre\'94 in its seventh season. He is part of the cast of the 
\f2\b Amazon Prime
\f0\b0  series, \'93El Cid\'94, the first series of this Spanish production platform premiered in late 2020 whose second season is already available, and David returns to star as Squire Lisardo. In addition, he is one of the choral actors starring in 
\f2\b Disney Plus
\f0\b0 \'91 first Spanish-produced series directed by Paco Le\'f3n, \'93Besos al aire\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 With theater play, \'93Retorno al hogar\'94 he has been touring all over the country in 2023. In addition, he has started his career as a writer with the publication, in the same year, of his poetry book \'93Piedra de madera\'94.
\f3\fs24 \
