\f2\fs32 \cf0 DELAPORTE
\f0\b0  is an Italian-Spanish electronic music project based in Madrid, created by Sandra Delaporte and Sergio Salvi. The two come from the black music scene in search of new languages with electronic music.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 They started uploading some covers to YouTube until they decided to showcase their own material covering all genres: JJCale, Talking Heads or Nina Simone, among others.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 After two years working together to find a sound suitable for the national and international market, they released their first songs. Creative atmospheres, beats and Sandra\'92s delicate voice are some of the elements that give personality and make their project different.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 They have been responsible for creating the music for the new version of the re-edition of the legendary Spanish TV show \'93Fama, a Bailar\'94 
\f2\b (Movistar +, #0.
\f0\b0 ) Their song \'93A Garden\'94 is the main soundtrack.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 So far they have played in festivals such as 
\f2\b Para\'edso, Noches del Bot\'e1nico, MadTownDays or Mar Abierto
\f0\b0 . They have shared the stage with Giorgio Moroder, Bomba Est\'e9reo, and played in Madrid, Valencia, Barcelona and Naples with a very good response from the public and critics.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Their first project is divided in two. \'94ONE\'94, released in September 2017, an EP with six tracks, five in English and one in Spanish and \'94UNO\'94, released in February 2018, the EP that closes this episode of Delaporte that contains six songs in Spanish, with rhythms and atmospheres that take you to places somewhat more Latin and warm, but that, nevertheless, floods you with Delaporte\'92s own sound, following the line of \'93ONE\'94. His second work \'94DOS\'94, released in early February 2019, an EP of 8 tracks, whose presentation single was, \'94Azul Marino\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 His first project is divided in two. \'94ONE\'94, released in September 2017, an EP with six tracks, five in English and one in Spanish and \'94UNO\'94, released in February 2018, the EP that closes this episode of Delaporte that contains six songs in Spanish, with rhythms and atmospheres that take you to places somewhat more Latin and warm, but that, nevertheless, floods you with Delaporte\'92s own sound, following the line of \'94ONE\'94. Their second work \'94DOS\'94, released in early February 2019, an EP of 8 tracks, whose presentation single was, \'94Azul Marino\'94 which is a success of listens and downloads on all music platforms.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 They have also collaborated with artists such as John Grvy or Alex Guerrero.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 The Para\'edso festival in Madrid has counted on them for its first edition, positioning them at the level of great national and international groups and DJ\'92s of the global electronic sphere.The first edition of 
\f2\b Aperol Fes
\f0\b0 t that took place in Madrid and Barcelona in 2019 counted on Delaporte as the only band for all its days, being three evenings in the incomparable setting of the Italian Embassy in Madrid and two evenings in the spectacular 
\f2\b Polo Club
\f0\b0  in Barcelona.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 On March 8, 2021, International Women\'92s Day, Delaporte launched their project called \'94Titanas\'94, with the aim of making women visible in the live industry. They teamed up with seven female performers such as Rigoberta Bandini, Amaral, Rozal\'e9n, Zahara, among others. Sandra Delaporte, the female part of the duo, has been chosen as the image of Amazon Fashion for one of their latest campaigns and both are the image of the sports brand 
\f2\b Nike
\f0\b0 . Sandra has been chosen in 2021 as ambassador and image of 
\f2\b Armani 
\f0\b0 Exchange for Portugal, Andorra and Spain.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Delaporte won 3 awards at the MIN (Independent Music) Awards. They were awarded with: \'94Amazon Music Award for Best Artist\'94, \'94Best Electronic Recording Award\'94 and \'94Soundie Award for Best Music Video\'94 for \'94Las Monta\'f1as\'94. In July 2021, they presented \'94Droga Dura\'94 and in September 2021, they presented their latest single called \'94La rosa del Penal (Llamar)\'94 with the collaboration of producer Sinego.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 \'a0They have been responsible for collaborating in the creation of the music for Prime Video\'92s \'94Sin huellas\'94 series \'94Sin huellas\'92
