\f0\fs96 \cf0 \cb2 PEPA CHARRO / \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 LA TERREMOTO DE ALCORC\'d3N
