\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 Between a thousand worlds is Pepa Charro and her alter ego \'93La Terremoto de Alcorc\'f3n\'94, with a long professional career that started with the theatre company \'93Diab\'e9ticas Aceleradas\'94 and which has taken her in the purest cabaret, cinema, theatre, television and avant-garde gastronomy.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She has done films such as \'93Piedras\'94 by Ram\'f3n Salazar,\'a0 \'93Carta a Eva\'94 by Agust\'ed Villaronga or \'93Los Amantes pasajeros\'94 by Pedro Almod\'f3var with whom she has collaborated artistically at the premiere parties as master of ceremonies and artistic coordinator since the film \'93Volver\'94 accompanying him twice to the Cannes Film Festival with \'93La mala Educaci\'f3n\'94 and \'93Julieta\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Among his latest releases are films such \'94Loli Tormenta\'94 by Agust\'ed Villaronga and \'94La Novia de Am\'e9rica\'94 by Alfonso Albacete.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Presenter of a multitude events as the \'93Shangay galas\'94, the anniversary of the magazine AD or any LGTBIQ+ event, collective with which she has been working for more than 20 years in Spain, Italy, England, Portugal, Belgium, France or USA.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Pepa has worked with artists like Fangoria and Hidrogenesse, also, she has produced his own show under the direction of Antonia San Juan and has coordinated the MACBA cabaret and created her own piece for the Museum of Contemporary Art Es Baluard, and inaugurated the MUSAC.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 The entertainment in different formats is part of the key to her popularity as a participant on programmes such as \'93Masterchef Celebrity\'94 on TVE, \'93Tu cara me suena\'94 or \'93Me resbala\'94 on Antena 3 or like presenter of \'93Niquela\'f3\'94 on the Netflix platform.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She acts in the series \'93Escenas de matrimonio\'94 and \'93Fen\'f3menos\'94 on Antena 3 and collaborates in other series such as \'93A\'edda\'94, \'93Paquita Salas\'94 or \'93Arde Madrid\'94, \'93Con el culo al aire\'94 and \'93El Ministerio del tiempo\'94.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She also participates in the RNE programme \'93Tarde lo que tarde\'94, always in a humorous tone, after having been on Onda Cero with \'93Surtido de Ib\'e9ricos\'94 with Carlos Latre and \'93Lo que es la vida\'94 with Nieves Herrero.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 She combines her artistic life with the hotel and catering business and is the owner and cultural promoter of Bar Flexas in Palma, where she brings together around 10,000 people every year with a very eclectic artistic line-up, collaborating with artists like El ni\'f1o de Elche, Joe Crep\'fasculo, Massiel, la Bienquerida, Pap\'e1 Topo, Milly Vanilly, Betty Missiego and Chicks on speed.
