\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 Entrepreneur, brand consultant, and international speaker Entrepreneur, business strategist, and brand ambassador, Natalie stands out for her expertise in storytelling and building purpose-driven brands with social impact and strong media presence. With roots in both Chicago and Spain, she combines her experience in strategic communications, partnerships, and creative entrepreneurship to turn bold ideas into high-impact businesses.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 \'a0
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 As an international speaker, Natalie inspires audiences with talks on leadership, conscious entrepreneurship, brand storytelling, fundraising, and entrepreneurial culture. She has collaborated with brands such as LVMH, Bumble, and Under Armour, and has been featured in media outlets like Vogue, La Vanguardia, and Forbes. She splits her time between Chicago and Barcelona with her husband and two children, dedicating herself to connecting people and brands to create innovative, purpose-driven projects.
\f3\fs24 \
