\f2\b\fs96 \cf0 \cb2 SURI
\f1\fs48 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 DJ \'b7 LGTBIQ+ activist
\f1\b\fs24 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 DJ Suri, international DJ and producer, winner in 2011 of an EMA (Spiral Music Award) to the revelation producer of the year. He has been dedicated to music for 18 years, performing in DJ cabins around the world, and has produced music and official remixes for major national and international artists such as Lady Gaga, PINK, Wyclef Jean, Beyonce, Paris Hilton, Azealia Banks, Rozalla or Monica Naranjo, among many others.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Currently, he is resident DJ of the worldwide brand \'93Papa Party\'94 of Eliad Cohen, of the nightclub Republik Madrid and Deseo 54 Valencia.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Undoubtedly it is worth mentioning the remix for Lady Gaga in 2016 of the single \'93Til It Happens To You\'94 song also nominated for an Oscar, making Suri the first Spanish to make a remix for the world-renowned and multi-awarded international artist, getting to reach No. 1 on the Billboard Dance Club Chart, The most important list of hits in the world. Thousands of national and international media echoed the two Spaniards who had remixed Lady Gaga.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 In 2018 remixed the song \'93secrets\'94 of the artist \'93PINK\'94 also getting the No.1 on the Billboard chart. DJ Suri has managed to have more than 15 remixes in the top 20 of that list.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 In 2018 came another great moment in Dj Suri\'92s career when he produced and composed the single of Paris Hilton\'92s return to music, an original track called \'93Summer Reign\'94 making the worldwide presentation of the track in a special party at Amnesia Ibiza with Paris Hilton.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Suri has managed to have all her original tracks and remixes in the top 5 of iTunes, having achieved her last two original singles \'93Papas World\'94 and the recent single released this 2022 \'93Yeah!\'94 in the No.1 of iTunes sales in Spain.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Suri has performed with her music all around the world at the most important events, as well as in the most recognized venues worldwide and at major festivals, especially for a LGTBIQ+ audience. Suri has headlined the biggest LGTBIQ+ festivals in the world, has performed at more than 17 Prides and is a regular attraction for the best brands in the world. He has performed at the World Pride in New York and Madrid and in 2023 he performed at the World Pride in Sydney, in front of more than 24,000 people, being the only Spaniard to perform for the official World Pride party.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 He has shared line-up and stage with artists such as Kylie Minogue, Mel C or Kelly Rowland, as well as being the opening act for M\'f3nica Naranjo\'92s 4.0 tour in Valencia.
\f3\fs24 \

\f0\fs32 Suri has a very personal style that has led his sound to be recognized worldwide, combining fresh and strong beats with powerful melodies and epic vocals, which make Suri\'92s sessions an unforgettable experience.
\f3\fs24 \
