\f2\fs32 \cf0 Rebeca Khamlichi
\f0\b0  (Madrid, 1987) is not a painter. She is a form of painting. Her universe is all mixed up with graphic design and XVII century religious iconography, cartoons and Michael Haneke, bubble-gum pink and Goya\'92s dark paintings, Spanish folk and Superfiat (a sort of \'93Concha Piquer sings haikus\'94).
